## Build
**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.cache

## App runtime data (keep folder, ignore contents)
App/data/*
!App/data/.gitkeep

## Published binaries in App/ (rebuild via scripts\publish-portable.bat)
App/*.dll
App/*.exe
App/*.pdb
App/*.json
App/*.xml
!App/data/

## Models (too large for git — keep on drive)
Models/fast/*
Models/quality/*
!Models/fast/.gitkeep
!Models/quality/.gitkeep
!Models/**/README.md

## Llama runtime binaries
Runtime/llama/*
!Runtime/llama/.gitkeep
!Runtime/llama/README.md

## Logs / caches
*.log
*.db
*.db-journal
App/data/prompt-cache/
App/data/logs/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
